      "id": "is-active",
      "name": "IsActive",
      "category": "GPUFastFourierTransform",
      "signature": "IsActive(Filter)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Filter",
          "type": "FPreFilter&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Bool",
      "docs": "Define a prefilter to be applied to the pixel Luma, used when forward transforming image data.\nUsed to boost the incoming pixel luma of bright pixels - useful to accentuate the influence\nof bright pixels during a convolution.\nPreFilter.x = MinLuma\nPreFilter.y = MaxLuma\nPreFilter.z = Multiplier\nWhen used in TwoForOneRealFFTImage, pixels Luma is limited by MaxLuma\nand Luma greater than MinLuma is scaled as Multiplier * (Luma - MinLuma) + MinLuma;"
